    "title": "Glam AI: Video & Photo Editor",
    "description": "Looking for a way to go viral easily? Want to make your content eye-catching and stand out among others? You\u2019re on the right page \u2014 check out Glam app\u2019s AI Magic, the perfect tool for your photos and videos!\r\n\r\nGlam is the ideal choice for those who don't want to follow trends but create them. We offer dozens of hot AI Styles for your photos and videos \u2014 travel to other universes in just one tap! Create better than anyone else with the Glam app.\r\n\r\n\u3010 AI MAGIC \u3011\r\n\r\n\u2022 Apply 200+ filters & effects to your video & photo content;\r\n\u2022 Enjoy multiple AI Styles: Anime, Cartoon, Fire and more!\r\n\u2022 You don't have to be a professional - create with in one tap;\r\n\r\n\u3010 AI MULTI-RESULTS \u3011\r\n\r\n\u2022 Try 50+ trendy and aesthetic photo edits;\r\n\u2022 Get 10 RESULTS with just one photo upload!\r\n\u2022 Explore different sides of your personality: Luxury, Renaissance, Polaroid, and many other styles.\r\n\r\n\u3010 VIDEO DIGITAL CLOTHES \u3011\r\n\r\n\u2022 Be the first one to catch the TREND;\r\n\u2022 Add sparkling coats or latex outfit to your VIDEOS;\r\n\u2022 Enjoy first-ever VIDEO FASHION TECHNOLOGY.\r\n\r\n\u3010 SHARE IT AND GO VIRAL \u3011\r\n\r\n\u2022 We always keep an eye on CURRENT TRENDS\r\n\u2022 We UPDATE our app 3-4 times a week\r\n\u2022 And wondering that our users could become POPULAR!\r\n\r\nBe the first one to try FIRE features and make your content even better with Glam Pro!\r\n\r\nGlam team is always looking for ways to improve the app.\r\nSo don\u2019t hesitate to send us your ideas and feedback:\r\n\r\n* email - contact@glamlabs.app\r\n* Instagram - @glam_app\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nUse #glamapp to tag us in your Social Media\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014